  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-01",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "쉬는 시간이 끝났어요. 교실에는 과자와 종이가 가득해요.",
      "category": "narration",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "384f042080418aa29f419f21e022763d3e1752d1d79cd9ffa1722da26a45d6b0",
      "bytes": 66284,
      "durationSeconds": 5.446,
      "peakDbfs": -3.11,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.4
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-02",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "어? 문밖에서 발소리가 나! 누구지?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "45fcd989314ee20425bdd50a0be41989e3ae4ec870995a69a616f8e5889504d5",
      "bytes": 53324,
      "durationSeconds": 4.347,
      "peakDbfs": -2.95,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.49
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-03",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "이 몸이 다 정리할 수 있지. 선생님만 안 오시면…",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "1576114770548983c9149e4e73bf2768e000176962b61968f7c33983d70619d6",
      "bytes": 60812,
      "durationSeconds": 4.974,
      "peakDbfs": -2.92,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.84
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-04",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "이게 다 뭐야!",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 3,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-04.mp3",
      "sha256": "79816009633a542d815030c30f95c916dce2e8feb39eb7e491277c7eaa6242b9",
      "bytes": 27692,
      "durationSeconds": 2.21,
      "peakDbfs": -2.7,
      "rmsDbfs": -22.01
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-05",
      "speaker": "marin",
      "text": "상황 보고. 선생님 도착. 정리 필요.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 4,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-05.mp3",
      "sha256": "dbbd0ab0364e93f45164fdf6a73009f583d5769e1fcfa8cce558d39279604490",
      "bytes": 55628,
      "durationSeconds": 4.54,
      "peakDbfs": -2.95,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.53
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-intro-01",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "마린, 까몽. 먼저 교실을 정리하자.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-intro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "0aec1cb87b8186fb5f27d6d155ae1a6a6c865c497802da9b428e02aa3c218863",
      "bytes": 55628,
      "durationSeconds": 4.544,
      "peakDbfs": -3.01,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.67
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-intro-02",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "어? 이 종이에 글자가 있어! 버려도 되는 걸까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-intro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "849179ea13286a5e0bd8cece952eb5b9db41afc930a7ae8a7074bbd07ebe3bbb",
      "bytes": 58220,
      "durationSeconds": 4.766,
      "peakDbfs": -3.11,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.18
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-intro-03",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "그 종이는 오늘 쓸 장식이야. 버리면 안 돼.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [
        "cleanup-paper"
      ],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-intro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "19cd6ea506306b5acf2f6aefa54a4c42f4cd064cad39b4e6ca413d5581ca4b00",
      "bytes": 57068,
      "durationSeconds": 4.672,
      "peakDbfs": -2.9,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.34
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-outro-01",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "이 몸의 정리 실력, 봤지? …종이도 안 구겼어.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-outro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "b54fd9dd11e1b46864aa1d39cb4b0676bc70f955221abb58bde9f97d7a2be491",
      "bytes": 62828,
      "durationSeconds": 5.138,
      "peakDbfs": -2.92,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.73
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-outro-02",
      "speaker": "marin",
      "text": "정리 완료. 종이 보관. …하트 모양 발견.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-outro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "c8e03ac5fee6499db0f82f1711f1a2f3877c5bc2017b343909d454ac08ab57f9",
      "bytes": 55916,
      "durationSeconds": 4.565,
      "peakDbfs": -3.5,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.63
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-outro-03",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "오! 하트도 별도 있어! 누가 만들었을까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-outro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "71fe7ac533495d1a03de5bc33dc11fe00f68a04735d4571e820599f7e3837f24",
      "bytes": 59084,
      "durationSeconds": 4.828,
      "peakDbfs": -4.17,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.82
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-intro-01",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "꽃도 있네? 이건 어디에 둘까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-intro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "673198c10f81ae7f30e57d24b875d103213ce0d5368bd4b89ade63abfd54e434",
      "bytes": 41228,
      "durationSeconds": 3.343,
      "peakDbfs": -2.93,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.58
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-intro-02",
      "speaker": "marin",
      "text": "꽃 확인. 세 송이. …예쁘다.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [
        "clue-flowers"
      ],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-intro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "6ea215f15725158698cbb4e6832f05f539110ff1f723074212f8030cb0678eb7",
      "bytes": 51308,
      "durationSeconds": 4.186,
      "peakDbfs": -2.83,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.17
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-intro-03",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "어? 편지도 있어! 누가 썼을까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-intro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "61a3f00a3b4c4784a114be2413fe3d2a70f7ad134a7a12aacb82535c24dd33f8",
      "bytes": 51308,
      "durationSeconds": 4.19,
      "peakDbfs": -2.7,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.54
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-outro-01",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "편지를 펼쳤어요. “선생님, 생일 축하해요!”라고 쓰여 있어요.",
      "category": "narration",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-outro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "84bdcee2238c615818d64847a70b0c3e83356be88a6102cab5ba12a661225dac",
      "bytes": 61676,
      "durationSeconds": 5.046,
      "peakDbfs": -3.6,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.32
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-outro-02",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "오늘 내 생일인 걸 어떻게 알았니?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-outro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "7b3e0d6057db3709f32b73707504a1e304936ef9ffe0e681a45db19d9697a0dd",
      "bytes": 41804,
      "durationSeconds": 3.399,
      "peakDbfs": -2.78,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.31
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-outro-03",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "내가 준비했지. …편지는 세 번 고쳐 썼어.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-outro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "4548dd5527c12aa059634df3b8ce9d94662c906cc16a5973105d15e4655b9827",
      "bytes": 56204,
      "durationSeconds": 4.589,
      "peakDbfs": -2.69,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.54
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-intro-01",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "우와! 깜짝 파티였구나! 같이 준비하자!",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-intro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "e5caa74823d08a5f73d2adc9ab2e0ac210a5d5082873e852f3869a203cf129f5",
      "bytes": 62252,
      "durationSeconds": 5.109,
      "peakDbfs": -3.81,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.17
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-intro-02",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "아직 케이크를 못 봤는데?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-intro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "3159040f792e8b4770c5d3570d0d3244b8370955353778eae587eaecf7ccf4c1",
      "bytes": 32588,
      "durationSeconds": 2.618,
      "peakDbfs": -3.28,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.96
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-intro-03",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "내가 숨겨 뒀지. …조금 먹으려 했어, 아니, 잘 지켰어!",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [
        "surprise-cake"
      ],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-intro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "a96a556a614142bdf621aaf27f6f0b1992dd95b47cd56e7c318518e7c0670bf5",
      "bytes": 64844,
      "durationSeconds": 5.306,
      "peakDbfs": -2.93,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.61
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-outro-01",
      "speaker": "marin",
      "text": "파티 준비 완료. …선생님, 생일 축하합니다.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-outro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "fb5f921612c5516f13d9e0430511b30f4fda4627779bd2e83510d3b37d75d868",
      "bytes": 56204,
      "durationSeconds": 4.595,
      "peakDbfs": -2.86,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.74
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-outro-02",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "우와! 교실이 파티 장소가 됐어!",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-outro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "894fb17d2d58fa88e6a006a3deb567da0dc86f500ed2f74bfe6e22229def54f0",
      "bytes": 49868,
      "durationSeconds": 4.071,
      "peakDbfs": -3.07,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.92
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-ending-01",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "교실이 엉망인 줄 알았는데, 나를 위해 준비한 거였구나.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "ending",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-ending-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "dc9961dea420462a8f7d0a176a28d904d812bb5951e642469080cb3adae72759",
      "bytes": 61964,
      "durationSeconds": 5.079,
      "peakDbfs": -3.01,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.38
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-ending-02",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "내 작전은 완벽했지. …네가 도와줘서 다행이야.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "ending",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-ending-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "1f9b203ef1cebcd4c760dcffdc2a8b6b08ba40db14791c7204c6ba33f7c2af1d",
      "bytes": 63980,
      "durationSeconds": 5.253,
      "peakDbfs": -2.98,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.63
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-ending-03",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "같이 하니까 더 재밌어! 다음 파티도 같이 할까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "ending",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-ending-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "6d1bec62f5f4d841394a066b742158aa84f113b338e14b12b37b3a1542cde058",
      "bytes": 63404,
      "durationSeconds": 5.199,
      "peakDbfs": -3.18,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.82
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-ending-04",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "이제 새 글을 읽고 마지막 정리를 해 보자. 이번에는 친구와 장소가 달라.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "ending",
